“Who was this?” — Find faces in your album and play, entirely on your device.

Photos are never uploaded. People are grouped on your phone, then you can enjoy 4 mini games.

What you can do
1) Who was this?
Guess the face behind the circle. Tap reveal to expand it.

2) Shuffle
Shake the bottle and meet someone at random — a gentle nudge to reconnect.

3) Tournament
A face knockout tournament. Winning lines thicken from left to right.

4) Ladder lottery
Pick a face, trace the path, and see hit or miss.

Privacy
- Album access is only used to group faces on your device
- Photos and face data are not uploaded to any server
- You can rescan anytime

A warm little app for remembering family, friends, and faces from the past.
